          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bright center stays low on the horizon at this latitude. An open view to the south matters most."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A esta latitud, el centro brillante se queda bajo en el horizonte. Lo más importante es una vista despejada hacia el sur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The darkest nights of the month come in the week around it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The darkest nights of the month come in the week around it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las noches más oscuras del mes llegan en la semana alrededor de ella."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The peak falls in daylight or twilight here, so only the edges of it reach a dark sky.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The peak falls in daylight or twilight here, so only the edges of it reach a dark sky."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí el máximo cae de día o durante el crepúsculo, así que solo sus extremos llegan a un cielo oscuro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The peak falls while the radiant is low here, so few meteors reach this sky.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The peak falls while the radiant is low here, so few meteors reach this sky."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí el máximo llega con el radiante bajo, así que pocos meteoros alcanzan este cielo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The public coordinates of the 63 national parks. Nothing about you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The public coordinates of the 63 national parks. Nothing about you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las coordenadas públicas de los 63 parques nacionales. Nada sobre ti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tasa máxima publicada es de %lld por hora con un cielo perfecto y el radiante, el punto del que parecen salir los meteoros, en el cenit (Organización Internacional de Meteoros)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization); it varies from year to year.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization); it varies from year to year."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tasa máxima publicada es de %lld por hora con un cielo perfecto y el radiante, el punto del que parecen salir los meteoros, en el cenit (Organización Internacional de Meteoros); varía de un año a otro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
