    "Turning forecasts off stops new requests. The last forecast stays on this device and counts less as it ages, then the park's usual clouds take over. The Moon, the stars and every score still work offline.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning forecasts off stops new requests. The last forecast stays on this device and counts less as it ages, then the park's usual clouds take over. The Moon, the stars and every score still work offline."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Al desactivar los pronósticos se detienen las solicitudes nuevas. El último pronóstico se queda en este dispositivo y cuenta menos con el tiempo; después rige la nubosidad habitual del parque. La Luna, las estrellas y todos los índices siguen funcionando sin conexión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
